    "updated_at": "2015-09-21T08:11:39Z",
    "body": "The initial IO is need either way for the file picker. And you'll always need IO to read data. If a JavaScript library around this idea becomes a de facto standard we could consider standardizing this. At this point I don't think it's clearly established that this is needed.\n",
